  "name": "Open Nursing Core Implementation Guide",
  "alternateName": [
    "ONC-IG",
    "Open Nursing Core IG"
  ],
  "description": "FHIR R4 implementation guide defining a standardised nursing data model covering the complete nursing process (ADPIE — Assessment, Diagnosis, Planning, Implementation, Evaluation). Provides 25+ profiles across four domains: foundation and safety (NEWS2, Braden Scale, Waterlow Score), relational and inclusive care (patient preferences, capacity assessments), fundamental care (elimination, hydration, pain, oral health, sleep), and specialised and mental health assessments. NHS-aligned, including CareConnect-NEWS2-Observation-1. Hosted on the UNICC open source portal, maintained by the Open Nursing Community. MIT, v1.0.0 (January 2026).",
  "url": "https://opennursingcoreig.com/",
  "codeRepository": "https://opensource.unicc.org/nursecitizendeveloper/open-nursing-core-ig",
  "license": "MIT",
