  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The only open FHIR R4 implementation guide dedicated to nursing — 25+ profiles covering the full ADPIE nursing process, NHS-aligned (NEWS2, Braden, Waterlow), hosted on the UNICC open source portal. v1.0.0 released January 2026. MIT licence. Assess at launch due to very early community adoption; the institutional backing of UNICC and the absence of any comparable open nursing IG gives it strong potential. Worth tracking as the first mover in a gap that affects every nurse-facing EHR implementation.",
